{{headline.en}}

Hello {{profile.firstName}},

{{#if profile.isOnWaitingList}}
you are on the waiting list for the event {{event.name}}.
{{else}}
great that you are joining! You have successfully registered for {{event.name}}.
{{/if}}

{{#if profile.isGuest}}
Your registration and further events
Only through your personal link can you register for further related events. When you register for another event, you
enter your registration data again and then confirm your email address. This ensures that the registration really comes
from you.
{{/if}}

Link to the event: {{event.url}}
Date: {{event.date.en}}
{{#if event.location}}
Location: {{event.location}}
{{/if}}
{{#if event.conferenceLink}}
{{#unless profile.isOnWaitingList}}
Conference link: {{event.conferenceLink}}
{{#if event.conferenceCode}}
Conference access code: {{event.conferenceCode}}
{{/if}}
{{/unless}}
{{/if}}

Do you want to save the date directly in your calendar?
{{event.icsLink}}

{{#if profile.isOnWaitingList}}
As soon as a spot becomes available and you move up from the waiting list, you will be informed by email.
{{else}}
You can't attend after all?
{{#if profile.isGuest}}
If your plans change, please unregister via the revocation link. This way, your spot can be given to another
person if necessary.
Revocation link: {{event.revocationLink}}
{{else}}
If your plans change, please withdraw your participation on the community platform. This way, your spot can be given to
another person if necessary.
{{/if}}
{{/if}}

{{#if profile.isGuest}}
All important information will be sent to you by email.
As you registered without a profile on the MINTvernetzt community platform, all important information about the event
will be sent to you by email. Therefore, it is best to keep these emails safe.

Please note: The links in our emails are personal and intended only for you. Please do not share them with others.
{{/if}}

We look forward to seeing you!

Best regards,
Your MINTvernetzt team